HOLD. Not O6 Proven. No HOLD lift. Submits peer_hint + app_payload_b64 to
local raven-node IPC and prints daemon envelope_b64. Does not construct
ATSAM/RVNA1 locally. Fail-closed: ATSAM_SESSION_REQUIRED,
ATSAM_LINEAGE_REVOKED.

